  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "How can you ask a useful question about the selected workload?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.1868667917448406,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Open Ask EMOS and ask about evidence, dependencies, modernization options, or the next",
      "start": 3.1868667917448406,
      "end": 9.225140712945592,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "governed step.",
      "start": 9.225140712945592,
      "end": 10.045153220762977,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask EMOS is an interface, not a third specialist.",
      "start": 10.045153220762977,
      "end": 13.716572858036272,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "A deterministic orchestrator routes the request to Portfolio Discovery, Enterprise",
      "start": 13.716572858036272,
      "end": 18.67392120075047,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Architect, or both, using the current context.",
      "start": 18.67392120075047,
      "end": 21.935334584115072,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Portfolio Discovery investigates ambiguity and evidence gaps.",
      "start": 21.935334584115072,
      "end": 26.836772983114447,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Enterprise Architect reasons across the six R choices.",
      "start": 26.836772983114447,
      "end": 33.86278924327705,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Deterministic validation and governance check the response, and explicit human approval",
      "start": 33.86278924327705,
      "end": 39.08105065666041,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "retains authority.",
      "start": 39.08105065666041,
      "end": 40.161976235146966,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "If AI reasoning is unavailable, EMOS labels the deterministic status and evidence",
      "start": 40.161976235146966,
      "end": 45.436147592245156,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "fallback. It does not pretend that a model answered.",
      "start": 45.436147592245156,
      "end": 49.405753595997496,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Agents for ambiguity. Workflows for predictability.",
      "start": 49.405753595997496,
      "end": 53.692182614133834,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules for governance. Humans for authority.",
      "start": 53.692182614133834,
      "end": 57.19587242026267,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, ask what evidence is missing.",
      "start": 57.19587242026267,
      "end": 59.607104,
      "chapter": 3
    }
  ],
